{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷風が気持ちいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｺﾞｰｰｰｰｰｰ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN22Q9439N1WQBQF31BFC7Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nﾌﾞｩｵｵｵｵｵｵｰｰｰ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドライヤーの音がすごいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他に何も聞こえないくらい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッスルプレスさんでもこんな感じの風を送る機械を使ってたなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はねーーーー!!(木下ゆうかさん風)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バウンドケーキとマカロンを作ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度のブログに載せます:*+.(( °ω° ))/.:+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのための材料の買い物をしているところです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私と織田奈那は、イオンじゃなくてジャスコ派です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の下のほくろ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN22SC0XEP961S4S6YC23EV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがあれば、なーこです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は反対側にも小さいほくろがあるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうど対称の位置に。\nカメラで映らない位の小さいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、見に来てください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type"